**定理。** 对全部上述参数，实际覆盖映射环面满足

$$\boxed{
H_1(\widetilde M_{g,h,k,p};\mathbb Z)
\cong\mathbb Z^R
\oplus(\mathbb Z/q)^c
\oplus(\mathbb Z/(qa))^{b-2}
\oplus(\mathbb Z/(qb))^{a-2}
